{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type Accessor<T> = T | (() => T);","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/accessor.ts#L12","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/lit-query/src/accessor.ts:12"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A value that can be passed directly or read from a zero-argument getter."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lit Query APIs read function accessors during host updates, so the getter can\ndepend on reactive host state."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const staticKey: Accessor<readonly unknown[]> = ['todos']\nconst reactiveKey: Accessor<readonly unknown[]> = () => ['todos', this.userId]","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype Accessor<T> = T | (() => T);\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/accessor.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/accessor.ts#L12)\n\nA value that can be passed directly or read from a zero-argument getter.\n\nLit Query APIs read function accessors during host updates, so the getter can\ndepend on reactive host state.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst staticKey: Accessor<readonly unknown[]> = ['todos']\nconst reactiveKey: Accessor<readonly unknown[]> = () => ['todos', this.userId]\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: Accessor\ntitle: Accessor\n---\n\n```ts\ntype Accessor<T> = T | (() => T);\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/accessor.ts:12](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/accessor.ts#L12)\n\nA value that can be passed directly or read from a zero-argument getter.\n\nLit Query APIs read function accessors during host updates, so the getter can\ndepend on reactive host state.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst staticKey: Accessor<readonly unknown[]> = ['todos']\nconst reactiveKey: Accessor<readonly unknown[]> = () => ['todos', this.userId]\n```\n"}
